---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: agriculturalNewsMerged.countries
  size: 1
  alias: country
permalink: "/sw/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
language: sw
pageLanguage: sw
---
<div id="goa-language-targets"
 data-url-en="/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-fr="/fr/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-ar="/ar/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-pt="/pt/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"
 data-url-sw="/sw/agricultural-news/{{ country.slug }}/"></div><section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
<div class="container">
{% set displayCountryName = country.localizedNames[pageLanguage] if country.localizedNames and pageLanguage != "en" else country.name %}
<p><a href="/sw/agricultural-news/">← Habari zote za kilimo</a></p>
<h1>{{ country.flag }} Habari za kilimo — {{ displayCountryName }}</h1>
<p class="lede">Maendeleo ya sasa na yaliyothibitishwa ya kilimo kwa nchi hii.</p>
{% set publishedCountryArticles = [] %}
{% for candidate in country.articles %}
  {% if (candidate.status == "official" or candidate.status == "published" or candidate.status == "verified") and candidate.lifecycle == "current" %}{% set publishedCountryArticles = publishedCountryArticles.concat([candidate]) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if publishedCountryArticles.length %}
{% for article in publishedCountryArticles %}
{% set translated = article.translations[pageLanguage or language] if article.translations else null %}
<article class="card" style="margin:16px 0;">
{% if translated and translated.title and translated.summary %}
<h2>{{ translated.title }}</h2><p>{{ translated.summary }}</p>
{% else %}
<p class="translation-pending-note" data-translation-status="pending"><small>Tafsiri haipo au bado haijakaguliwa; kichwa na muhtasari uliopo vinaonyeshwa.</small></p>
<h2>{{ article.title }}</h2><p>{{ article.summary }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p><small>Chanzo: {{ article.source }} · Imethibitishwa: {{ article.verified }}</small></p>
<a href="{{ article.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Soma chanzo cha awali →</a>
</article>
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
<div class="card"><h2>Habari zinathibitishwa</h2><p>Bado hakuna habari za sasa zilizothibitishwa zilizochapishwa kwa nchi hii.</p><p>Habari zitaongezwa baada ya kuthibitishwa kutoka chanzo rasmi au kinachoaminika.</p></div>
{% endif %}
</div></section>